# argument                           |   type         |  require?   |   default
# .......................................................................................................
tag                                  |   string       |  optional   |   toymc
run                                  |   integer      |  optional   |   0
ntoymc                               |   integer      |  optional   |   1
physics-hypothesis                   |   string       |  optional   |   3f_osc
fit-param-opt                        |   string       |  optional   |   NONE
param-values-option                  |   string       |  optional   |   randomize-all;prefit-errors
fitter                               |   string       |  optional   |   minuit
config                               |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
mesg-thresholds                      |   string       |  optional   |   verbosity.xml
nthreads                             |   integer      |  optional   |   -1
#
with-stat-fluct,without-stat-fluct   |   boolean_list |  optional   |   with-stat-fluct
store-spectra,discard-spectra        |   boolean_list |  optional   |   discard-spectra
start-at-true,start-at-central       |   boolean_list |  optional   |   start-at-true
rethrow-unphysical,accept-unphysical |   boolean_list |  optional   |   rethrow-unphysical
true-from-filename                   |   string       |  optional   |   NONE 
true-from-objname                    |   string       |  optional   |   central_values
pot-override                         |   double       |  optional   |   -999
load-prior-from-file                 |   string       |  optional   |   none
prior-fit-number                     |   integer      |  optional   |   0
prior-file                           |   string       |  mandatory  |   -
#
tweak-parameter-set                  |   string       |  optional   |   none
force-tweak-size                     |   double       |  optional   |   0
#
flip-true-octant                     |   boolean      |  optional   |   0
read-data, generate-data             |   boolean_list |  optional   |   generate-data
